26-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-04-21T15:20:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T17:36:46Z","closed_at":"2026-04-29T17:34:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.stable, 4.7.dev f94bbfc07\n- Not reproducible in: 4.5.2.stable (except for light theme, in which case it's always reproducible)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (f94bbfc07) - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.126.18) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn the default (dark) theme, both line length guidelines became significantly less visible since 4.6 with the introduction of the Modern theme and its new default color preset (with a lower contrast than before). That said, switching to the Classic theme does not restore the lines' contrast back to how it was in 4.5. Instead, you need to set Color Preset to Godot 3 to get the previous lines' contrast back.\n\nOn a light theme, the soft line length guidelines is invisible, and the hard line length guideline is very hard to see. This is not a new issue in the Modern theme; it was already present in 4.5.\n\nWhile you can manually adjust the line length guideline colors in the Editor Settings, we should adjust the default opacity of the line length guidelines to resolve this issue on the default and light color presets at least.\n\n### Default\n\n4.6+ | 4.5\n-|-\n<img width=\"927\" height=\"138\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20f97177-cd6c-437a-baff-76ec131b8dbe\" /> | <img width=\"964\" height=\"138\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf591eba-3f20-4b9c-8dec-766cda211345\" />\n\n### Light\n\n4.6+ | 4.5\n-|-\n<img width=\"927\" height=\"138\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3b514f2-7e9b-45cf-bdf6-c7e62a81d993\" /> | <img width=\"964\" height=\"138\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7bddbe35-3989-4a25-b013-52a26011c393\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new script, then look at the lines drawn at columns 80 and 100.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118817/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}